<title>HONG KONG: Cho Hung Bank seen in US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Cho Hung Bank seen in US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cho Hung Bank has verbally mandated Societe Generale Asia to arrange a US$100 million floating rate note issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of one year and an all-in return of about 54 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Sources said the deal may be completed on a club deal basis depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>Cho Hung Bank's rating was downgraded to Baa1 from A3 by Moody's Investors Service in February this year.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039  http://www.hk97.com</p>
